WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.440
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.386
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.386 --> 00:00:08.886
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:09.204
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.204 --> 00:00:11.758
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.758 --> 00:00:15.356
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.363 --> 00:00:23.243
Write an independent answer about parameter changes.

00:00:23.243 --> 00:00:28.695
Reveal the first explanation for comparison.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.987
Mark the first question Reviewed after comparing the reasoning.

00:00:31.987 --> 00:00:39.902
Answer the prompt-context question in your own words.

00:00:39.902 --> 00:00:45.239
Reveal the second explanation and compare the distinction.

00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:49.581
Mark the second question Reviewed.

00:00:49.581 --> 00:01:00.068
Write why retrieval supplies context but still requires verification.

00:01:00.068 --> 00:01:05.625
Reveal the retrieval explanation and compare it with the written answer.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.989
Mark the final question Reviewed.

00:01:09.989 --> 00:01:15.202
Inspect the completed three-question progress indicator.

00:01:15.202 --> 00:01:21.910
Reset the activity for another independent practice session.
